
                       geant4-11-04-ref-00
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Updated particle properties to PDG-2025.
 o Implemented mechanism to weight score in G4VPrimitiveScorer.
 o In G4GoudsmitSaundersonMscModel, added back the "range-rejection" like
   optimisation to the stepping algorithm in order to bring back the number
   of simulation steps to values as before previous modification.
 o Updated Reverse MC simulation to work in MT mode.
 o Removed HepRepFile and Qt3D visualisation drivers, no longer viable to
   develop and maintain.
 o New dataset version: G4PhotonEvaporation-6.1.2.
 
---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

