processes/hadronic
------------------
- cross_sections (hadr-cross-V11-03-09)
  o G4ChargeExchangeXS: fixed units inside SampleTforPion() method.
  o In G4NeutronInelasticXS, G4NeutronElasticXS, G4NeutronCaptureXS, added
    extra flag to enable/disable reading and usage of precise data in resonance
    region, allowing to reduce RSS memory for simple applications. For
    applications requiring higher precision of neutron transport, the
    flag should be defined via G4HadronicParameters::SetUseRFilesForXS(true).
  o Fixed compilation warning on Intel/icx compiler for overlapping comparison
    on condition in G4EMDissociationCrossSection.
- models/cascade (hadr-casc-V11-03-01)
  o Fixed compilation warning on Intel/icx compiler for overlapping comparison
    on condition in G4BigBanger, fixes typo in the computation of probability.
- models/coherent_elastic (hadr-cohe-V11-03-05)
  o Fixed cases of non-accurate checks on potential numerical problems in
    computing scattering angles in G4NuclNuclDiffuseElastic, G4DiffuseElastic
    and G4AntiNuclElastic, addressing compilation warnings on Intel/icx
    compiler for overlapping comparison on conditions.
- models/de_excitation (hadr-deex-V11-03-25)
  o G4LevelReader, G4GammaTransition, G4photonEvaporation: addressing problem
    reports #2672, #2588 and #2451. The vector of IC probabilities is limited
    by number of levels in an atom; if in gamma level data all IC transitions
    are zero, then instead of K-shell probability, 1.0 is assigned to the last
    existing level; electron emission is sampled if nuclear excitation is above
    the bound level and if number of electrons on electron shell is above 1;
    more accurate sampling of final state using masses of the nucleus plus
    masses of electrons from electron shells.
  o G4StatMFMicroCanonical: fixed computation of temperature.
  o G4DeexPrecoParameters: reduced upper limit of energy per nucleon for the
    pre-compound model 30 to 15 MeV, according to the prescription of
    Botvina A. S. et al. Nucl. Phys. A, 475:663, 1987.
- models/inclxx (hadr-inclxx-V11-03-03)
  o Fixed compilation warning for implicit type conversion on macOS/XCode
    in G4INCLAntinucleiAtrestEntryChannel::getAnnihilationPosition().
- models/lend (hadr-lend-V11-03-06)
  o Removed the default evaluation string from G4LEND. This change means the
    user only needs to update the G4LENDDATA environment variable to switch to
    a different nuclear data library.
  o Fixed various Coverity reported defects and implicit conversion compilation
    warnings in macOS/XCode.
- models/pre_equilibrium (hadr-pre-V11-03-08)
  o G4PreCompoundModel: send to evaporation all fragments with excitation
    energy exceeding energy limit.
- models/qmd (qmd-V11-03-00)
  o Fixed reported Coverity defect for potential division by zero.
- models/quasi_elastic (hadr-qelastic-V11-03-00)
  o Fixed compilation warning on Intel/icx compiler for overlapping comparison
    on condition in G4QuasiElRatios.
- util (hadr-util-V11-03-06)
  o G4HadronicParameters: added extra flag to enable/disable usage of precise
    cross-section data for neutrons in resonance energy region.

